\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This stereotype is applicable to compsite classes that represent components of type \i Allocatable.\i0  It comes along with three predefined tags \b CORE\b0 , \b CPU\b0 , \b THREAD \b0 to define the context to which the \i Allocatable \i0 is assigned to.\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
