\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This stereotype indicates a timing trigger that is initiated by the OS. The trigger is usually attached to a \i &lt;&lt;Runnable&gt;&gt;\i0  or \i &lt;&lt;RunnableEx&gt;&gt;\i0  operation. The trigger corresponds to the AUROSAR TimingEvent\par%0D
\par%0D
