\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This communication attribute defines the initial value of the data element, seen by all receivers of the data element\i .\i0  The configuration of this attribute is mandatory for each data element defined in the \i TransportedInterface\i0 .\par%0D
\par%0D
\b Related References:\b0\par%0D
- AUTOSAR Specifiaction Virtual Functional Bus\par%0D
