\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This communication attribute defines whether the sender has to be informed when the data has been sent correctly. The configuration of this attribute is optional for each event element defined in the \i TransportedInterface\i0 .\par%0D
\par%0D
\b Related References:\b0\par%0D
- AUTOSAR Specifiaction Virtual Functional Bus\par%0D
- Tag &lt;EVENT_SND_TX_ACK_TIMEOUT&gt; defined for the stereotype \i &lt;TransportedInterface&gt;\i0\par%0D
