\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\f0\fs20 This stereotype is applicable to AUTOSAR SW-C that are provided by a 3rd party and which are not meant to be designed with the means of the \i Composite \i0 and the \i Allocatable\i0 . In addition is the \i External \i0 connected to the TransportedInterface in different way than the \i Composite \i0 and the \i Allocatable\i0 .\lang1031\f1\par%0D
}%0D
