		<ITag type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 4688133a-e6a3-4e6f-9c3f-3b5757564316</_id>
			<_name type="a">BACKGROUND_ACTIVATION</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\f0\fs20 This attribute is indication that the runnable entity is used to perform background activities. Possible values are TRUE or FALSE. The corresponding RTE-Event is the BackgroundEvent. Feature will be supported beginning with AUTOSAR version 4.0.\lang1031\f1\par%0D
\par%0D
\b Related References:\b0\par%0D
- AUTOSAR Specifiaction of RTE\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTime>
