			<_name type="a">PORT_ACCESS</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">PORT_ACCESS = All%0D
All port will be accessible from the runnable%0D
PORT_ACCESS = None%0D
No port will be accessible from the runnable%0D
</_text>
			</IDescription>
