			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">RunnableEx</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.23.2020::10:54:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 A \i &lt;&lt;RunnableEx&gt;&gt;\i0  method identifies a class method that is invoked by the RTE on the basis of RTE-Events. The R\i unnableEx\i0  can be assigned to a different thread and thus it can be executed\i  \i0 in another thread than the one that is assigned to the \i Allocatable \i0 it is part of.\par%0D
\par%0D
\b Related References:\b0\par%0D
- AUTOSAR Specifiaction of RTE\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
