			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.23.2020::10:54:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\lang1033\f0\fs20 The \i TransportedInterface \i0 is defined to depict the communication that is managed through the AUTOSAR RTE. \lang1031\f1\par%0D
