\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This group attribute defines the default initial value for all data elements with the stereotype \i &lt;Data&gt;\i0  defined in the \i TransportedInterface.\i0  The value defined here can be overwritten by the value defined for a specific data element. The configuration of this attribute within the definition of the \i TransportedInterface\i0  is optional.\par%0D
