\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This enumerator type defines the possible events raised by a \i &lt;&lt;event&gt;&gt;\i0  attribute defined within a \i TransportedInterface\i0 . Selectable literals are:\b\par%0D
\b0\par%0D
\lang1033\b\i\f1 DataReceived:\b0\i0  A runnable entity on the receiver side is triggered by the RTE to receive and process a data attribute defined in the \i TransportedInterface\i0 . Corresponding RTE-Event is \i DataReceivedEvent\i0  and is relevant for sender-receiver communication.\lang1031\f0\par%0D
\par%0D
\lang1033\b\i\f1 DataSendCompleted:\b0\i0  A runnable entity on the provider side is triggered by the RTE to receive transmission acknowledgement notifications for a data attribute defined in the \i TransportedInterface\i0 . Corresponding RTE-Event is \i DataSendCompletedEvent\i0  and is relevant for sender-receiver communication.\lang1031\f0\par%0D
\par%0D
\b Related References:\b0\par%0D
- AUTOSAR Specification of RTE\par%0D
}%0D
