\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 This enumerator type defines the possible events raised by a \i &lt;&lt;mode&gt;&gt;\i0  attribute defined within a \i TransportedInterface\i0 . Selectable literals are:\b\par%0D
\b0\par%0D
\lang1033\b\i\f1 ModeSwitchOnEntry:\b0\i0  A runnable entity is triggered by the RTE as result of a mode switch when the new mode is entered. Corresponding RTE-Event is \i SwcModeSwitchEvent\i0 .\lang1031\f0\par%0D
\par%0D
\lang1033\b\i\f1 ModeSwitchOnExit:\b0\i0  A runnable entity is triggered by the RTE as result of a mode switch when the new mode is left. Corresponding RTE-Event is \i SwcModeSwitchEvent\i0 .\lang1031\f0\par%0D
\par%0D
\b Related References:\b0\par%0D
- AUTOSAR Specification of RTE\par%0D
\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
