			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.23.2020::10:54:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">To be used for Application componenet that instances are described using InstancEr language and use Transported Interfaces:%0D
The componet will use the root instance which name MUST be the compoent name as input for SWC/ARXml generator. Then the generated ARXML as input for VBF generator. At the end all generated files are added to the component scope.</_text>
