		<ITag type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID d2743c59-1fc9-46c5-b3c5-d0fa47f44f73</_id>
			<_name type="a">AutosarGen</_name>
			<_displayName type="a">tag_0</_displayName>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1251\deff0\deflang1026{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset204 Calibri;}{\f1\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Calibri;}{\f2\froman\fprq2\fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset204{\*\fname Arial;}Arial CYR;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang1033\f0\fs22 State of the generation \f1 is\f0  controlled by &quot;\b Autosar\i Gen\b0\i0 &quot; tag using the &quot;\b\i ON\b0\i0 &quot;, &quot;\b\i OFF\b0\i0 &quot; and &quot;\b\i INH\b0\i0 &quot; values. Effect of the tag value \f1 is\f0 :\par%0D
\pard\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f2\'b7\tab\f0 &quot;\b\i OFF\b0\i0 &quot; specifies that element and all of its sub-elements (if there are some) should use the standard generation till the end of the tree or element with \ldblquote\b\i ON\b0\i0\rdblquote  state;\par%0D
\f2\'b7\tab\f0 &quot;\b\i ON\b0\i0 &quot; specifies that element and all of its sub-elements (if there are some) should use the AUTOSAR compliant generation till the end of the tree or element with \ldblquote\b\i OFF\b0\i0\rdblquote  state;\par%0D
\f2\'b7\tab\f0 &quot;\b\i INH\b0\i0 &quot; specifies inheritance (no change) of the state, defined by the parent element.\lang1026\f3\fs20\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTime>
			<_typeOf type="r">
				<IHandle type="e">
