\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\f0\fs22 Attributes, stereotyped with &lt;&lt;\b ConstPtr\b0 &gt;&gt; \f1 are\f0  generated as constant pointers if corresponding attribute is defined in the model as \ldblquote reference\rdblquote . Stereotype \f1 does not\f0  have effect for attributes, not defined as \ldblquote reference\rdblquote .\lang1026\f2\fs20\par%0D
