\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\lang1033\f0\fs20 &lt;&lt;PreCompiled&gt;&gt; stereotype can be applied to \ldblquote Static\rdblquote  and \ldblquote Const\rdblquote  attribute. \par%0D
Such attribute is defined as constant (#define). \par%0D
Constants are exposed in the static attributes header file according to their visibility (Public/Private).\lang1036\f1\par%0D
\par%0D
Note that only &lt;&lt;PreCompiled&gt;&gt; attributes cannot be from a composed type.\par%0D
( Class or structure) \par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
