		<IStereotype type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 267723ea-d7bd-447d-b016-383eda0a4618</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">UUID</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.23.2020::10:54:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1251\deff0\deflang1026{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset204{\*\fname Arial;}Arial CYR;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\fs20 This is the package or class unique ID.\par%0D
ID for packages is 12 bits (0-4095), which means 4096 packages in total.\par%0D
ID for classes is 32 bits, upper 12 bits are reserved to add the package ID. Rest of the bits is used as unique identifier of the class in the package -&gt; 20 bits (0-1048575), which means 1048576 classes in a package.\par%0D
Whole ID creates unique identifier for a class in the whole project. In the generated code model ID is transformed thru a hash function. For reference purpose, hashed ID is also present in the model. Both values are automatically updated by the generation chain, but could be changed by hand if needed.\lang1026\f1\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTime>
